<title>GERMANY: Buba sets next two repo tenders at 3 pct rate.</title>
<headline>Buba sets next two repo tenders at 3 pct rate.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday that it would set its next two securities repurchase tenders at a fixed three percent rate.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank has kept its main money market rate, the repo, fixed at three percent since August and money market dealers had not expected a change in the rate at today's council meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
